# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — these must never enter git history. A token committed to a private
# repo is still permanent and leaks the moment the repo is shared or flipped
# public. Re-auth after a restore instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/hosts.yml
**/credentials/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.token
**/*.state
**/Trust Tokens*
**/kwallet*
**/*secret*
**/*password*
**/.npmrc
**/.pulse-cookie
**/.claude.json
**/key.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Spicetify generated artifacts (regenerate with `spicetify apply`).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/spicetify/spicetify
**/spicetify/jsHelper/
**/spicetify/css-map.json
**/spicetify/globals.d.ts
**/spicetify/*.exe

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime state / caches / logs — regenerated by the apps themselves.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/*.log
**/*.log.*
**/logs/
**/Cache/
**/GPUCache/
**/Code Cache/
**/DawnWebGPUCache/
**/GPUPersistentCache/
**/buffers/
**/watch_later/
**/*.swp
*~
